{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CORA (Counter Offensive Rapidfire Automata) is a top down shooter created by Empty House Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(CORA contains bright, flashing lights that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. It is a bullet hell after all.)</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Story-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a CORA unit, built by the Galactic Empire for military use, but you and many other CORA units decided to leave and with that came the collapse of the Empire. You now settle on a strangely familiar planet to spend the rest of your days with other rogue units, but the star system's planet is getting dim and even worse, there are foreign enemies attacking your planet unprovoked. Can you fend off these invaders and restore your home star back to its former state?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Credits-</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EmptyHouse &amp; fruitymario</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EmptyHouse</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EmptyHouse &amp; fruitymario</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and Writing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fruitymario</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FaultyRGB</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2524260?t=1759312270","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2524260?t=1759312270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524260/9d2f0d705228cf56f3d01dddd892dc56a8a01c6e/capsule_